  "description": "Seam 8. One case per AN-01 event plus identify. input.swiftFunction names the ClickyAnalytics.swift function (identify: PostHogSDK.shared.identify at CompanionManager.swift:161-163, the case's own anchor) and input.arguments its Swift argument labels; the matching AnalyticsEvents method on a default catalogue must produce expected.name and expected.properties exactly (every key, no extras; {} when Swift passes no properties). For identify, expected.distinctId and expected.properties are the identify distinct id and person properties. character_count is Swift String.count, i.e. grapheme clusters, ported as StringInfo.LengthInTextElements (character-count-emoji). transcript-included and response-included pin AN-03: the full text is sent until the owner flips the catalogue's one content switch. Parity spec AN-01, AN-03.",
